<div class="swagger-ui doc-view mt-[60px] h-[calc(100%-60px)]"><div><div class="information-container wrapper"><section class=""><div><div class="info"><hgroup class="main"><h2 class="title">The Odds API<span><small><pre class="version"> 4 </pre></small><small class="version-stamp"><pre class="version">OAS 3.0</pre></small></span></h2></hgroup><div class="description"><div class="renderedMarkdown"><p>To access the API, get a free API key from https://the-odds-api.com</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><div><div class="scheme-container !shadow-none border-b border-b-black/10"><section class="items-end schemes wrapper"><div><span class="servers-title">Servers</span><div class="servers"><label for="servers"><select id="servers"><option value="https://api.the-odds-api.com">https://api.the-odds-api.com</option></select></label></div></div></section></div></div><div></div><div class="wrapper"><section class=""><div><span><span><div class="opblock-tag-section is-open"><h3 class="opblock-tag" id="operations-tag-sports" data-tag="sports" data-is-open="true"><a class="nostyle" href="#/sports"><span>sports</span></a><small><div class="renderedMarkdown"><p>Get a list of in-season sports.</p></div></small><div class="info__externaldocs"><small><a href="https://the-odds-api.com/liveapi/guides/v4/#get-sports" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link">Find out more</a></small></div><button aria-expanded="true" class="expand-operation" title="Collapse operation"><span class="opblock-summary-link icon icon-chevron-up-light "></span></button></h3><div class="no-margin"> <div class="operation-tag-content"><span><div class="opblock opblock-get" id="operations-sports-get_v4_sports"><div class="opblock-summary opblock-summary-get"><button aria-expanded="false" class="opblock-summary-control"><span class="opblock-summary-method">GET</span><div class="opblock-summary-path-description-wrapper"><span class="opblock-summary-path" data-path="/v4/sports"><a class="nostyle" h